        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties present this excellent two bed terrace property c.87.48 sqm/ c.941.41sqft  “A2” rate home to the market. Ideas for anyone looking to downsize. Located in a very popular development. Built to the highest standard this home is sure to impress. This property offers bright and  spacious living accommodation with the benefit of country living. Accommodation comprises of hallway, kitchen/dining, guest wc, sitting room, bathroom, two bedrooms. Tyrrells Brook is located on the Dublin Side of Edenderry Town just 20kms from the M4 Motorway. Edenderry is an excellent commuter location with superb schools and sporting clubs all nestled within the locality. The larger towns of Tullamore, Mullingar and Newbridge are just a short drive away. Viewing Highly recommended. An opportunity not to missed. Viewings By Strict Appointment Only.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nHallway: Wooden floor, downstairs storage\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining; Wooden floor, light fitting, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splashback area, stainless steelsink, oven, hob, extractor fan\r\n\r\nGuest WC: Tiles, WHB,WC , extractor fan\r\n\r\nSittingroom: Wooden floor, double doors leading to garden area\r\n\r\nBathroom: Bath, tiled  floor, tiled surround, extractor fan, WHB, WC\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:  Wooden floor, fitted wardrobe,\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Wooden floor. Fitted wardrobe, blinds\r\n\r\n\r\n Features:\r\n\r\nComposite front door\r\nPVC double glazed windows\r\nSelected curtains and light fittings included\r\nBarna Shed\r\nLocated in a cul de sac\r\nMains Water\r\nMains Sewage\r\nAir to water heating system\r\nOutside Bin bay\r\nBuilt  c. 2025\r\nc. 87.46 sqm / c.941.41 sqft\r\n\r\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\r\n\r\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is \r\ntaken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. \t\r\n\r\nLicence No:001492"
      },
